1
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,340
This is how I'll become.

2
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,820
This is how I'll become.

3
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,920
Supreme Commander!

4
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,770
A hero!

5
00:00:21,853 --> 00:00:23,637
This is my story!

6
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:02,537
I've never seen a dream.

7
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:06,337
It's not even a dream.

8
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:07,937
I've never seen it.

9
00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:13,297
I've never hoped that I was.

10
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:16,720
That's when you were me.

11
00:01:17,340 --> 00:01:23,617
I've never been able to.

12
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:26,957
I'll be you on the same way.

13
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:33,040
I'll be you on the dark side.
I'll be you on the same way.

14
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:35,277
I'll be

15
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,190
you

16
00:01:36,273 --> 00:01:43,200
on

17
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,680
the same way.

18
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,980
So that's what she meant
by physically demanding?

19
00:02:08,260 --> 00:02:09,300
No fair.

20
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:15,940
Things are really starting to heat up!

21
00:02:16,060 --> 00:02:20,417
Coming up next in round two, we have
Shushu Tsuruka of the Seven Squadron!

22
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:21,330
Hell yeah!

23
00:02:21,413 --> 00:02:23,760
Versus the Hata Wakata of the Six!

24
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:28,400
Both competitors specialize
in hand-to-hand combat!

25
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:31,077
I have a feeling this is
gonna be an entire battle!

26
00:02:31,160 --> 00:02:32,177
Watch this, sneaky!

27
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:34,500
I'm about to clobber her! Okay!

28
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:37,956
And then maybe you'll show
me some appreciation after?

29
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,190
Uh…

30
00:02:41,273 --> 00:02:42,103
Huh?

31
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:48,320
Yes, Shiho.

32
00:02:48,540 --> 00:02:51,893
Since you lost your match,
you get to be our cheerleader.

33
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:53,637
Good luck, Sahara.

34
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:54,550
You got this.

35
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:56,120
You can count on me.

36
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:57,460
I'll make you proud.

37
00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:05,657
Since we both like close combat, why don't
we hold off on our abilities until later?

38
00:03:05,740 --> 00:03:06,570
Okay!

39
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:10,160
Ready, set, let the battle begin!

40
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,860
Here I come!

41
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:14,354
Sahara starts off with a gracious kick,

42
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:18,220
but Shushu grabs her by
the leg and slams her!

43
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:20,676
She follows it up with a yellow drop!

44
00:03:24,580 --> 00:03:26,720
Sahara grabs Shushu from behind

45
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:29,840
and hits her with a German silk leg!

46
00:03:31,240 --> 00:03:32,700
It's not over yet!

47
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:35,920
I'm so tired.

48
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:38,140
That was long enough.

49
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,252
Break out the abilities!

50
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:41,590
Hooray!

51
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,760
It was just starting to get going!

52
00:03:43,900 --> 00:03:45,357
Fine, you're gonna get it!

53
00:03:45,440 --> 00:03:47,097
What number do you think she'll do?

54
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:48,540
Just one or maybe two?

55
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,249
I would guess three or so.

56
00:03:50,860 --> 00:03:53,957
Both of their abilities center
around physical strength.

57
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:55,540
This'll be a short match.

58
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:57,580
Paradigm Shift!

59
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:00,520
Ha! Yeah!

60
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:02,600
Oh my!

61
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,977
That's so neat!

62
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:06,240
Okay, it's my turn!

63
00:04:06,580 --> 00:04:08,340
Crazy Shape!

64
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:11,640
On three!

65
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,680
One, two!

66
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,440
Huh?

67
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:20,000
Paper Beats!

68
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:26,840
I win rock paper scissors!

69
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,540
You totally cheated!

70
00:04:28,940 --> 00:04:31,822
Sahara unleashed her
awesome Crazy Shape ability!

71
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,577
It allows her to boost
her strength for the

72
00:04:34,660 --> 00:04:37,240
precise amount of time
she sets in advance.

73
00:04:38,220 --> 00:04:40,680
One minute minimum, 60 maximum.

74
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:44,318
The shorter the time allotted,
the stronger she gets.

75
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:48,560
However, her ability has a mandatory
three minute cool down period.

76
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:51,460
Nice move, keep it up, Sahara.

77
00:04:52,140 --> 00:04:53,260
Why you? No!

78
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:05,780
Your sign is impressive, but
it makes you easy to die! Huh?

79
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,780
And it makes you an easy target!

80
00:05:20,740 --> 00:05:21,570
Shuzu?

81
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:28,400
Yuki, you don't have to give me that look.

82
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:30,920
Well, are you ready to give up now?

83
00:05:31,220 --> 00:05:32,340
Me give up?

84
00:05:32,500 --> 00:05:33,857
You've got to be joking.

85
00:05:33,940 --> 00:05:36,377
I've only begun to show you what I can do.

86
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:38,440
Oh, wow, you've really got guts.

87
00:05:38,660 --> 00:05:40,000
It's weird to me, too.

88
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:42,140
Why am I so determined?

89
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,160
Come on, Shushu.

90
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,889
Having a boyfriend is fun.

91
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:48,456
Jeez, you sound like a broken record.

92
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:51,407
I just don't get why
you're so opposed to it.

93
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:53,896
There's never a dull moment with him.

94
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:58,757
And seeing that look of joy on his face,
it's the best feeling in the world.

95
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:02,017
Whoa, it's rare to find a girl
so devoted to her man nowadays.

96
00:06:02,100 --> 00:06:03,740
You're so old-fashioned.

97
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:07,700
You do you, but I'm not interested
in romance with some guy.

98
00:06:07,980 --> 00:06:10,333
I'm looking for something more exciting.

99
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:16,500
I've been thinking about
joining these guys lately.

100
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:19,447
If I went to Mato, I
bet I'd never get bored.

101
00:06:19,940 --> 00:06:22,097
Every single day would be a total blast!

102
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:24,200
Very on-brand. Isn't it?

103
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:27,957
Hmm, I guess you just don't
understand what I'm going through.

104
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:30,158
But you'll get it one of these days.

105
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:34,140
Yuki, keep your eyes on me.

106
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:36,260
Because I'm about to win!

107
00:06:36,960 --> 00:06:40,917
Don't you think you'd have an easier
time moving around if you were smaller?

108
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:45,412
It's important to assess the situation
and tailor your ability accordingly!

109
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,217
You think smaller is better?

110
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:49,829
That kind of self-control
is a snooze-fest.

111
00:06:50,780 --> 00:06:55,460
I live by one motto, go
big or go home. Get ready!

112
00:06:55,820 --> 00:06:57,480
Let's paradigm shift!

113
00:06:57,880 --> 00:07:00,920
I'll push the envelope and crush you!

114
00:07:05,760 --> 00:07:08,900
I didn't see that coming. And... Bang!

115
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:30,460
I was too big for you to dodge, wasn't I?

116
00:07:33,500 --> 00:07:34,540
Take this!

117
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:52,400
Hey, Ref, can you see
if she's unconscious?

118
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:53,920
Uh-huh, sure!

119
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:55,080
She did it!

120
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:58,020
Miss Shushu won her match! Yeah!

121
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:00,950
One!

122
00:08:01,660 --> 00:08:02,490
Two!

123
00:08:04,880 --> 00:08:05,710
Huh?

124
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:13,240
She got back up?

125
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,720
Ha ha ha!

126
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:17,082
That's part of Sahara's ability!

127
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:20,137
If she loses consciousness
while her skill is active,

128
00:08:20,220 --> 00:08:22,337
her heightened killer
instinct takes control.

129
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,860
and will continue to fight on its own!

130
00:08:29,020 --> 00:08:31,314
She'll attack enemies and allies alike,

131
00:08:31,700 --> 00:08:34,406
but it only makes her
that much more powerful.

132
00:08:37,140 --> 00:08:39,240
Sahara can sleep anytime, anywhere.

133
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:41,836
That happens to be her secret weapon.

134
00:08:46,460 --> 00:08:48,400
One, two, three!

135
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:51,060
It's all over, folks!

136
00:08:51,420 --> 00:08:54,120
The winner is Sahara Wakasa!

137
00:08:57,580 --> 00:09:00,457
All because of my incredible
cheerleading skills!

138
00:09:00,540 --> 00:09:02,952
She took her down in three minutes, Vlad.

139
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:06,750
Shushu!

140
00:09:06,833 --> 00:09:07,796
How are you feeling?

141
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:09,371
There's no need to worry.

142
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:11,600
I got her all patched up.

143
00:09:16,060 --> 00:09:16,890
Oh, no!

144
00:09:17,080 --> 00:09:18,139
Your shirt ripped!

145
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:21,677
Sahara, get the hell off me, dammit!

146
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,590
I must've...

147
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:25,460
Here, take this! Shushu!

148
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:29,070
Commander...

149
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:32,360
I'm so sorry for losing my match.

150
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:33,917
You almost had her.

151
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:36,588
We will discuss where
you can improve later.

152
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:39,620
I think you better go get changed. Sure.

153
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:47,620
I looked like an idiot.

154
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:50,380
And Yuki saw the whole thing.

155
00:10:06,800 --> 00:10:07,630
Shushu?

156
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:14,640
Um, do you want anything to drink?

157
00:10:15,100 --> 00:10:17,688
I can grab it for you
while you get dressed.

158
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:20,120
No, I'm okay.

159
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:23,405
If there's anything I
can do, just let me know.

160
00:10:24,240 --> 00:10:25,840
I am the caretaker.

161
00:10:27,900 --> 00:10:33,180
Can you take care of my memories and
erase that pitiful excuse for a match?

162
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:42,860
I think it sucks you didn't win, but
I don't think it was pitiful at all.

163
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,940
You mean it?

164
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:52,722
To be perfectly honest, I wanted to see
more of the wrestling you did at the start.

165
00:10:53,740 --> 00:10:56,387
You would have if she
hadn't been a buzzkill.

166
00:11:02,420 --> 00:11:03,420
Hey, you here?

167
00:11:04,100 --> 00:11:04,930
Uh...

168
00:11:05,013 --> 00:11:06,820
Can you close your eyes for a sec?

169
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:08,670
Uh...

170
00:11:08,753 --> 00:11:09,583
Uh, sure.

171
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,280
Hey, Shushu!

172
00:11:30,220 --> 00:11:33,480
To be fair, I did tell
you to close your eyes.

173
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,017
Okay, but why the hell did you kiss me?

174
00:11:36,100 --> 00:11:37,060
Well, I...

175
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:40,590
Uh...

176
00:11:41,640 --> 00:11:42,470
Hmm...

177
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:43,710
Uh...

178
00:11:43,793 --> 00:11:47,057
I figured I would chase the shock
of losing with an even bigger shock!

179
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,434
That's the power move!

180
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,150
Uh...

181
00:11:53,233 --> 00:11:57,400
I can't tell him how I feel
until I get him to like me more!

182
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:04,120
Any anomalies in Mato? Nei?

183
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:06,750
No.

184
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,400
There's nothing out of the...

185
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:17,710
Huh?

186
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,100
A spy?

187
00:12:24,680 --> 00:12:25,510
Wow.

188
00:12:25,740 --> 00:12:27,446
We only just broke our cover.

189
00:12:28,040 --> 00:12:29,137
Not bad.

190
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:33,740
Tell the others I said hi, and
that the battle begins now.

191
00:12:40,240 --> 00:12:41,500
Who was that?

192
00:12:42,060 --> 00:12:42,890
What's wrong?

193
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:44,314
Did you see something?

194
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:46,490
I...

195
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:54,210
Shuki?

196
00:12:54,293 --> 00:12:56,373
Where in the world are they coming from?

197
00:12:58,500 --> 00:13:00,440
Don't worry, you can relax.

198
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,800
My barrier is impenetrable.

199
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:06,120
This flimsy thing is a barrier?

200
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,160
A humanoid?

201
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:13,200
I am Riren and this absurdity
fills me with laughter!

202
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:17,960
No way!

203
00:13:18,300 --> 00:13:20,017
That thing cracked my barrier!

204
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:22,041
We're calling off the exhibition.

205
00:13:22,660 --> 00:13:24,460
What a bunch of pests.

206
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:26,717
It's about time you went extinct.

207
00:13:26,800 --> 00:13:28,520
You're a dying breed.

208
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:32,160
All hands prepare for battle!

209
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:35,020
Tenka! I'm on it.

210
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:37,717
I'll take the non-combatants
back to the dorm.

211
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:40,094
And have Nei give you her recon report!

212
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:44,920
Destroy every last Shuki! Yes, ma 'am!

213
00:13:48,580 --> 00:13:50,640
I'll handle this one on my own!

214
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:55,430
Commander!

215
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:57,650
Shushu!

216
00:13:58,560 --> 00:14:00,620
Can you fight? Yeah!

217
00:14:03,520 --> 00:14:04,740
Paradigm Shift!

218
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,700
He's my boot!

219
00:14:09,280 --> 00:14:11,339
I'm already feeling as good as new!

220
00:14:12,400 --> 00:14:13,520
Like this!

221
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:18,040
Don't let up on the crowd control!

222
00:14:18,260 --> 00:14:19,436
I'll cover your six!

223
00:14:25,060 --> 00:14:27,560
No, not them. You're going somewhere!

224
00:14:28,060 --> 00:14:29,260
I'm your opponent!

225
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,620
Not you either!

226
00:14:34,980 --> 00:14:37,780
But perhaps I'll burn you down to a crisp!

227
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:45,990
Yachiyo!

228
00:14:46,073 --> 00:14:46,903
Are you alright?

229
00:14:49,680 --> 00:14:51,739
He's gonna be a tough one to crack.

230
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:57,630
Huh?

231
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:06,520
Just now, you stepped in because you knew
the lightning was coming ahead of time!

232
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:08,840
You bastard!

233
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:10,420
You'll pay for that!

234
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:15,930
Commander!

235
00:15:16,013 --> 00:15:18,640
Let me ride on Yuki's
back with you! With her?

236
00:15:18,940 --> 00:15:20,820
Two people at the same time?

237
00:15:21,060 --> 00:15:22,957
But we've never tried that before!

238
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:24,377
Alright, get on! Huh?

239
00:15:24,460 --> 00:15:25,290
Huh?

240
00:15:25,373 --> 00:15:26,440
You can trust me.

241
00:15:31,260 --> 00:15:33,940
Let's go, the three of us. Right!

242
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,060
I've got a gut feeling

243
00:15:37,660 --> 00:15:39,180
that with two masters,

244
00:15:39,900 --> 00:15:42,120
he'll take on a more powerful form.

245
00:16:11,600 --> 00:16:13,017
So what do you think, Yuki?

246
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:14,457
Ready to use new powers?

247
00:16:14,540 --> 00:16:16,077
Let's give them hell!

248
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:19,117
Power is coursing through me!

249
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:21,137
I bet I could do it!

250
00:16:21,220 --> 00:16:23,440
Now that move she did back then?

251
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:28,448
I'll use the same method as
Brand Break to channel my energy!

252
00:16:30,860 --> 00:16:31,820
Howling Blast!

253
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:37,620
So that's what two can do! Perfect!

254
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:40,097
Now we can annihilate
the Swarm in one blow!

255
00:16:40,180 --> 00:16:41,533
But what about Yachiyo?

256
00:16:41,620 --> 00:16:42,600
She'll be fine.

257
00:16:42,820 --> 00:16:44,917
The sixth squadron is in great hands.

258
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,120
They've got Tenka.

259
00:16:46,480 --> 00:16:48,421
There's still two more humanoids?

260
00:16:48,580 --> 00:16:49,440
Yes, ma 'am.

261
00:16:49,600 --> 00:16:52,680
I can't see them now, but I'm sure. Huh.

262
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:54,021
All right, then.

263
00:16:54,300 --> 00:16:55,712
We'll take it from here.

264
00:17:03,900 --> 00:17:05,740
I won't let you outshine me.

265
00:17:09,700 --> 00:17:12,797
We'll give them something
better than an exhibition match.

266
00:17:12,880 --> 00:17:15,120
We'll give them a Commander Showdown!

267
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,030
Torture!

268
00:17:19,113 --> 00:17:22,437
Lady Ted and Lady Kyo are out
there fighting and I'm stuck here?

269
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:24,957
It's because the dorm has
the sturdiest barrier.

270
00:17:25,040 --> 00:17:28,440
But I can barely see from
so far away, it's not fair!

271
00:17:28,920 --> 00:17:30,077
I want to watch!

272
